    "created_at": "2016-08-15T17:32:33Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-08-15T17:32:33Z",
    "body": "Part of the mistake here is assuming that the definition of \"same-origin\" only applies to URLs; it does not, but instead applies to the many other things that also have an origin.\n\nClosing, but happy to continue clarifying in the closed thread.\n",
